  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "BODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f54f1652491e4857253279999a4bdd3795f0bb021d09dc459c1045d345bc4fa2.png] \n\nAccording to the question:\n\nNow,\n\nGiven equation: 9 × 2 − (150 ÷ 5) + 24 + (32 ÷ 8) × 6 + 15 = 71\n\n**1) Interchange 6 and 5**\n\nNew equation: 9 × 2 − (150 ÷ 6) + 24 + (32 ÷ 8) × 5 + 15\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS/PEMDAS:\n\n⇒ 9 × 2 − __**(150 ÷ 6)**__ + 24 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 5 + 15\n\n⇒ __**9 × 2**__ − 25 + 24 + __**4 × 5**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**18 − 25**__ + 24 + 20 + 15\n\n⇒ __**−7 + 24**__ + 20 + 15\n\n⇒ __**17 + 20**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**37 + 15**__\n\n⇒ 52 ≠ 71 (Incorrect)\n\n**2) Interchange 2 and 6**\n\nNew equation: 9 × 6 − (150 ÷ 5) + 24 + (32 ÷ 8) × 2 + 15\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS/PEMDAS:\n\n⇒ 9 × 6 − __**(150 ÷ 5)**__ + 24 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 2 + 15\n\n⇒ __**9 × 6**__ − 30 + 24 + __**4 × 2**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**54 − 30**__ + 24 + 8 + 15\n\n⇒ __**24 + 24**__ + 8 + 15\n\n⇒ __**48 + 8**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**56 + 15**__\n\n⇒ 71\n\n71 = 71 (Correct)\n\n**3) Interchange 9 and 6**\n\nNew equation: 6 × 2 − (150 ÷ 5) + 24 + (32 ÷ 8) × 9 + 15\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS/PEMDAS:\n\n⇒ 6 × 2 − __**(150 ÷ 5)**__ + 24 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 9 + 15\n\n⇒ __**6 × 2**__ − 30 + 24 + __**4 × 9**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**12 − 30**__ + 24 + 36 + 15\n\n⇒ __**−18 + 24**__ + 36 + 15\n\n⇒ __**6 + 36**__ + 15\n\n⇒ __**42 + 15**__\n\n⇒ 57 ≠ 71 (Incorrect)\n\n**4) Interchange 5 and 15**\n\nNew equation: 9 × 2 − (150 ÷ 15) + 24 + (32 ÷ 8) × 6 + 5\n\nPerform operations according to BODMAS/PEMDAS:\n\n⇒ 9 × 2 − __**(150 ÷ 15)**__ + 24 + __**(32 ÷ 8)**__ × 6 + 5\n\n⇒ __**9 × 2**__ − 10 + 24 + __**4 × 6**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**18 − 10**__ + 24 + 24 + 5\n\n⇒ __**8 + 24**__ + 24 + 5\n\n⇒ __**32 + 24**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**56 + 5**__\n\n⇒ 61 ≠ 71 (Incorrect)\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
